  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요~&#160;</p><p>2학년 동물과 에너지 - 소화 단원에서 외울 내용이 너무 많더라구요..</p><p>아이들이 시험볼 때 외우기보다는 지금부터 조금씩 외우고 익숙해지면 좋을 것 같아 여러 방법을 찾아보다가 재과만에 김혜경 선생님께서 22년도에 올려주신 야구골든벨을 사용해보기로 했씁니다!&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/362\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/362</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/362\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=fMHu&amp;datanum=362\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/362\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/362\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>과학실 배치를 모둠 배치로 바꾸면서 공간을 넉넉하게 빼고 홈, 1루, 2루, 3루 베이스를 뽑아서 붙여두었습니다!&#160;</p><p>그리고 캔바 피피티 이용해서 아이들이랑 수업을 했는데 생각보다 되게 열심히 참여하더라구요!!!&#160;</p><p>특히, 야구 연고지가 있는 지역에서는 학생들이 더 재미있게 참여할 수 있을 것 같았습니다.&#160;</p><p>저는 시작할 때 KBS 야구 중계 음악 &#39;치고 달려라&#39; 를 틀어두면서 도입했습니다!&#160;</p><p>그리고 모둠별로 화이트보드도 하나씩 주어서 아웃카운트랑 본인 모둠 점수 체크할 수 있도록 했습니다.&#160;</p><p>타자가 아닌 자리에 남아있는 학생들이 지루해하지 않을까 걱정했는데 그 학생들도 본인 모둠 점수 세느라 정신 없더라구용</p><p>&#160;</p><p>야구 골든벨 PPT</p><p><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGwxpnXfog/wsRHE20rlzuAfTcYY4fGEA/view?utm_content=DAGwxpnXfog&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=hbd106da30e\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.canva.com/design/DAGwxpnXfog/wsRHE20rlzuAfTcYY4fGEA/view?utm_content=DAGwxpnXfog&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=hbd106da30e</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"야구 버전\" data-og-description=\"닝닝수혀닝 님이 디자인한 프레젠테이션 살펴보기\" data-og-host=\"www.canva.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGwxpnXfog/wsRHE20rlzuAfTcYY4fGEA/view?utm_content=DAGwxpnXfog&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=hbd106da30e\" data-og-url=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGwxpnXfog/wsRHE20rlzuAfTcYY4fGEA/view\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGwxpnXfog/wsRHE20rlzuAfTcYY4fGEA/view?utm_content=DAGwxpnXfog&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=hbd106da30e\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGwxpnXfog/wsRHE20rlzuAfTcYY4fGEA/view?utm_content=DAGwxpnXfog&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=hbd106da30e\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">야구 버전</p><p class=\"og-desc\">닝닝수혀닝 님이 디자인한 프레젠테이션 살펴보기</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.canva.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>각 베이스 그림&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGxB1_KPio/QkWfIKz7gW3zbLzFevcZRA/view?utm_content=DAGxB1_KPio&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=h81dad85095\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.canva.com/design/DAGxB1_KPio/QkWfIKz7gW3zbLzFevcZRA/view?utm_content=DAGxB1_KPio&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=h81dad85095</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"홈\" data-og-description=\"닝닝수혀닝 님이 디자인한 트라이폴드 브로셔(EU) 살펴보기\" data-og-host=\"www.canva.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGxB1_KPio/QkWfIKz7gW3zbLzFevcZRA/view?utm_content=DAGxB1_KPio&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=h81dad85095\" data-og-url=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGxB1_KPio/QkWfIKz7gW3zbLzFevcZRA/view\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGxB1_KPio/QkWfIKz7gW3zbLzFevcZRA/view?utm_content=DAGxB1_KPio&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=h81dad85095\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGxB1_KPio/QkWfIKz7gW3zbLzFevcZRA/view?utm_content=DAGxB1_KPio&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;utlId=h81dad85095\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">홈</p><p class=\"og-desc\">닝닝수혀닝 님이 디자인한 트라이폴드 브로셔(EU) 살펴보기</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.canva.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학생들이 띵커벨 활동하는 것보다 직접 움직이면서 하니까 더 재미있더라구요!&#160;</p><p>저는 빨리빨리 진행해서 20문제를 2번 돌려서 수업했습니다.&#160;</p><p>진행하느라 목이 아프기는 하지만 저는 학기말에 한 번더 해볼 것 같아요!!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1619daae120b5d0ec3092dd66b1e8436376ee2e5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"269\" height=\"94\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1619daae120b5d0ec3092dd66b1e8436376ee2e5\" data-origin-width=\"120\" data-origin-height=\"42\"><div class=\"figcaption\">· 저작물 &#8231; 저작자명 및 출처, CCL 조건을 표시하면 자유롭게 이용할 수 있지만, 상업적으로는 이용할 수 없습니다.· 상업적 이용을 원하면 저작권자와 별도의 계약이 필요합니다.</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
